[35.556191, "o", "\r\n== The demo: npm run dev:platform runs in a second terminal. The demo kills the runner in turn 2.\r\n\r\n"]
[35.556398, "o", "$ npm run demo:loop --silent\r\n"]
[35.919035, "o", "== The owner sends: \"Please read 3 files.\" (task demo-1795040288812)\r\n"]
[35.951559, "o", "POST /v1/commands -> 200 {\"status\":\"accepted\",\"commandId\":\"demo-1795040288812\"}\r\n"]
